{"version":1,"id":"noah-kahan-the-great-divide","title":"The Great Divide","artist":"Noah Kahan","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/noah-kahan/the-great-divide/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b; 1 phrase(s) used deterministic fallback","credits":"Composed by: Gabe Simon and Noah Kahan","chords":[{"symbol":"B/F#","canonical":"B/F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m7","canonical":"C#m7","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E2","canonical":"E2","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,6,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E7M/B","canonical":"Emaj7/B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,4,8],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Emaj7/B"},{"symbol":"D#m","canonical":"D#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#/A#","canonical":"F#/A#","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,1,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I can't recall the last time that we talked","columns":43,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":21,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":40,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"About anything but looking out for cops","columns":40,"beats":7,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":20,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E2","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"We got cigarette burns in the same side of our hands","columns":52,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":50,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"We ain't friends, we're just morons","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Who broke skin in the same spot","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m7","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E2","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"But I've never seen you take a turn that wide","columns":46,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":25,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E2","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm high enough to still care if I die","columns":44,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":24,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E2","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"So I tried to read the thoughts","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"That you'd worked overtime to stop","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E2","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"You said \"Fuck off\", and I said nothing for a while","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":33,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão 1]","columns":14,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"     You know I think about you all the time","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"  And my deep misunderstanding of your life","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"     And how bad it must have been for you back then","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"  And how hard it was to keep it all inside","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão 1]","columns":10,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"     I hope you settle down, I hope you marry rich","columns":58,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":47,"beat":4},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":54,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"  I hope you're scared of only ordinary shit","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"     Like murderers and ghosts and cancer on your skin","columns":62,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":51,"beat":4},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":58,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"  And not your soul and what He might do with it","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"You inched yourself across the great divide","columns":45,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":23,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E2","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"While we drove aimlessly along the Twin State line","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":29,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":49,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I heard nothing but the bass in every ballad that you'd play","columns":60,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":26,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E2","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"While you swore to God the singer read your mind","columns":49,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":47,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"But the world is scared of hesitating things","columns":44,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":41,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, they only shoot the birds who cannot sing","columns":48,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":27,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":46,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm finally aware of how shitty and unfair","columns":46,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":18,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":33,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"It was to stare ahead like everything was fine","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B/F#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m7","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E2","column":49,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão 2]","columns":14,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"     You know I think about you all the time","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B/F#","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"  And my deep misunderstanding of your life","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E7M/B","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"     And how bad it must have been for you back then"